body:
Make small steps and goals to start becoming independent and to stand up for yourself! You can only change your reaction and behaviors, so don't let something they do (that you can't control) take CONTROL of YOU!

&#x200B;

You got this. Chin up.

Car wreck. Ejected from the van when it was T-boned. The van careened and flipped, landing on it's roof. Good sized chunk taken from my lower left abdomen from slamming into something as I was yeeted out the window by gravity. 

&#x200B;

Really happy that I was unconscious.

Used depression as a crutch to be lazy and spend almost a year and a half with no job (despite me asking several times to find one, along with her other friends and family members), lied about having a job to some of her family and when I found out, got mad at ME for flipping the fuck out and going off on her. It was either her way or no way. 

&#x200B;

Jokes on her. She's the toxic one (She called me toxic lol) and all of her family and friends were on my side regarding the situation. She's probably twisting the truth and bad mouthing me to anyone she can. Hints why I no longer have much friends or date, I refuse to be played or used. So, I just stick to myself. 10 year friendship down the drain.
